WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.074 --> 00:00:25.658
Cupcake wanted to play.

2
00:00:25.659 --> 00:00:29.445
But Berry was with Bok Choy.

3
00:00:29.446 --> 00:00:32.999
They were folding paper.

4
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:41.470
Cupcake frowned. "Berry is my friend!"

5
00:00:41.471 --> 00:00:44.750
She went over to them.

6
00:00:44.751 --> 00:00:49.275
"What are you doing?" she asked.

7
00:00:49.276 --> 00:00:53.600
"We're making boats," Berry said.

8
00:00:53.601 --> 00:01:01.409
"Bok Choy is teaching me."

9
00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:07.898
Cupcake sat down. "I'll make one too."

10
00:01:07.899 --> 00:01:17.909
"Watch." Bok Choy made a neat fold.

11
00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:24.483
Berry's fold wasn't neat.

12
00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:29.544
Cupcake's paper ripped.

13
00:01:29.545 --> 00:01:34.259
"Ugh!" she said.

14
00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:41.498
Bok Choy nodded. "Just try again."

15
00:01:41.499 --> 00:01:45.869
Berry made another fold.

16
00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:52.431
"Uh-oh." This one wasn't neat either.

17
00:01:52.432 --> 00:02:00.624
Cupcake's paper ripped again.

18
00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:07.524
"This isn't fun!"

19
00:02:07.525 --> 00:02:10.726
Berry tried again.

20
00:02:10.727 --> 00:02:16.605
His fold still wasn't neat.

21
00:02:16.606 --> 00:02:20.264
Cupcake crushed her paper.

22
00:02:20.265 --> 00:02:23.676
"This stinks!"

23
00:02:23.677 --> 00:02:26.945
"Ugh!" Berry said.

24
00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:29.464
Cupcake looked at him.

25
00:02:29.465 --> 00:02:35.045
"Folding paper is too hard, right?"

26
00:02:35.046 --> 00:02:39.198
"Yes, it's hard," Berry said.

27
00:02:39.199 --> 00:02:47.945
"But you're complaining too much!"

